UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I am sure you noticed that at trick two why I led a low club, hoping if West had the @CA he would think it was a singleton. And that worked out well. An important thing to remember when declaring is that the opponents don't know what you hold. And sometimes you can mislead them into mis defending as I did with my club play.

|
