mb|2C|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|MB|?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|As I said earlier, now most of the time I should pass if I have clubs or bid my suit at the 2-level if it is not clubs. However, rarely, if I have a really good hand, I can bid 3@C or 3 of my suit if not clubs. |
