nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Doubling and then bidding at the 3 level playing ^*BDONT^*n shows a good hand. A direct jump to the 3 level is preemptive. I am not really strong enough to bid 3@C so I am going to pass. I would bid 3@C with a couple of more points, particularly with a singleton or void.|
